  "title": "Recovery-objective assessment",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Recovery-objective assessment</h2><p>Compare recovery test results with business requirements.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs5-f1\">Was the RTO met?</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs5-f1\"><option value=\"Yes\">Yes</option><option value=\"No\">No</option><option value=\"Only if all data is current\">Only if all data is current</option><option value=\"RTO does not concern time\">RTO does not concern time</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs5-f2\">Was the RPO met?</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs5-f2\"><option value=\"Yes\">Yes</option><option value=\"No\">No</option><option value=\"RPO measures only recovery labor\">RPO measures only recovery labor</option><option value=\"Data age is irrelevant\">Data age is irrelevant</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs5-f3\">Data-loss interval exceeding RPO, in minutes</label><input id=\"isc-m1-tbs5-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs5-f4\">Availability percentage for the stated month</label><input id=\"isc-m1-tbs5-f4\" type=\"text\"></div></section>",
